<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>HTML Formatting SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B>Welcome</B> to the <I>amazing</I> world of SAMI!</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>This text has <B>bold</B> and <I>italic</I> formatting.</P>

<SYNC Start=6000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><FONT COLOR="red">Red text</FONT> using font color tags.</P>

<SYNC Start=9000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><U>Underlined text</U> is also supported.</P>

<SYNC Start=12000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B><I>Bold and italic combined</I></B> in one line.</P>

<SYNC Start=15000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><FONT COLOR="#00FF00">Green text</FONT> with hex color.</P>

<SYNC Start=18000>
<P Class=ENUSCC><B>Line one is bold</B><BR><I>Line two is italic</I></P>

<SYNC Start=21000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Normal <B>then bold</B> then <I>then italic</I> then normal.</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
